{"sections":[{"slug":"C-星代数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"C-星代数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"C*-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"C*-代数"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>$C^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">代数是一个</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Banach代数","text":"Banach <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">配备运算</span> $(-)^*$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$a^{**}=a$;</li>\n<li>$(a+b)^*=a^*+b^*$,</li>\n<li>$(\\lambda a)^* = \\bar\\lambda a^*$ ($\\lambda \\in\\mathbb{C}$),</li>\n<li>$(a b)^*=b^*a^*$;</li>\n<li>$\\|a^* a\\|=\\|a\\|^2$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>$C^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">代数上的范数可由代数结构唯一确定</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为谱半径公式给出</span>\n$$\r\n\t\\|A\\|^2 = \\sup\\{|\\lambda|\\colon A^*A-\\lambda \\,\\text{不可逆}\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/vonNeumann代数","text":"von Neumann <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}